.DS_Store
.env

# LoRA adapters in outputs/checkpoints/ (e.g. lab2_peft_adapter, manual_ppo,
# trl_baseline) are small and meant to be committed for reproducibility —
# not ignored.

# Raw stdout dumps from training runs (progress bars, warnings) — messy,
# regenerable, not meant to be committed. The actual results (jsonl metrics,
# comparison plots, rouge_results.json) ARE committed since the README links
# to them directly.
outputs/logs/*.log

data/*
!data/.gitkeep
